		(property "ReqNotes" "Open-drain output: fit a pull-up to the destination rail (up to 5.5 V, above or below VCC) and size it for the 32 mA at 4.5 V / 24 mA at 3 V sink limit. Use for wired-OR flags and one-direction level shifting. Input tolerates 5.5 V at any VCC; Ioff protects when unpowered. Tie the input to VCC or GND when unused. Pins 1 and 5 have no internal connection."
			(at 114.3 86.36 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name yes)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
